{"record_id":"cn_nev-C001","kind":"competitor","market":"CN","brand":"Xiaomi","model":"SU7","generation":"SU7 1st gen (2024-); 2026 update launched 2026-03-19 (CarNewsChina calls it an 'updated'/'new generation' SU7; Sohu/Autohome list it as 2026款 of the same series)","powertrains":["BEV"],"launched":"2024 (2024款); 2026 update 2026-03","rationale":"Indirect competitor one price tier below the 5 Series Li/i5: Sohu lists the 2026 SU7 at 21.99-30.39万 vs BMW 5 Series 36.8-52.59万 on the same page. Autohome's SU7 page lists BMW 5 Series among its popular comparisons (热门对比), and SU7 owners on Sohu benchmark it against BMW 3 Series/Audi A4; CarNewsChina benchmarks it against Tesla Model 3. Best-selling premium EV sedan in China; sets buyer expectations for HMI, phone ecosystem, ADAS and value that the 5 Series Li is judged against.","next_generation":null,"next_generation_evidence_tier":"D","url":"https://k.m.autohome.com.cn/6962/"}
{"record_id":"cn_nev-C002","kind":"competitor","market":"CN","brand":"NIO","model":"ET7","generation":"ET7 1st gen (NT2.0 platform, 2022-); 2024 refresh launched 2024-04-25","powertrains":["BEV"],"launched":"2022; 2024 refresh 2024-04","rationale":"Direct price overlap: Sohu lists the 2024 ET7 at 42.8-45.8万, inside the 5 Series Li/i5 range. Executive-sedan format with a 3,060 mm wheelbase, air suspension and rear-comfort focus. A Sohu owner explicitly cross-shopped BMW, Mercedes, Audi and Lexus before buying. No 2025/2026 update found in fetched sources; still listed on Sohu.","next_generation":null,"next_generation_evidence_tier":"D","url":"https://db.auto.sohu.com/trim_172513/dianping"}
