{"record_id":"cn_nev-C004","kind":"competitor","market":"CN","brand":"Luxeed (HIMA: Huawei x Chery)","model":"S7","generation":"S7 1st gen (2023-); facelifts 2025-08 (ADS 4, air suspension) and 2026-03 (896-channel lidar)","powertrains":["BEV"],"launched":"2023-11; updates 2025-08 and 2026-03","rationale":"Indirect competitor at 22.98-28.98万 (Autohome, 2025 update; the rival it names is the Xiaomi SU7). Included because Sohu S7 owners explicitly compare it with a family BMW 5 Series (more space, more enjoyable to drive) and an Audi A6L, so it draws buyers from BBA households. It is Huawei's ADS/HarmonyOS showcase sedan. Sales are reportedly weak.","next_generation":null,"next_generation_evidence_tier":"D","url":"https://db.auto.sohu.com/trim_172313/dianping"}
